<h3>Supported keys and user actions</h3>

<div class="kd-text kd-text-secondary">
    <p>When the input is focused, there are actions available in addition to the standard DateInput actions.</p>
</div>

<ul class="keyboard-legend">
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Alt</span>
            +
            <span class="key-button">Down arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            opens the popup with the time selection popup.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Alt</span>
            +
            <span class="key-button">Up arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="button-preview button-descr">or</span>
            <span class="key-button">Esc</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            closes the time selection popup.
        </span>
    </li>
</ul>

<h3>Date Input</h3>

<TelerikBlazorDemos.Shared.KeyboardShortcuts.DateInputList IsNested="true" />

<div class="kd-text kd-text-secondary">
    <p>In the Date-Time popup, there are a few keys that perform the general actions. The sections below provide more specific datails.</p>
</div>

<ul class="keyboard-legend">
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Tab</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="button-descr">and</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Shift</span>
            +
            <span class="key-button">Tab</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            moves the focus in the popup between buttons (such as the Now button, the Set button and the Date and Time switchers) and the time carousels (in the time portion).
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Enter</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            activates the focused buttons in the popup and selects a date in the calendar portion.
        </span>
    </li>
</ul>

<h3>Time Popup Portion</h3>

<ul class="keyboard-legend">
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Right arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            moves focus to the next carousel (time portion selector) in the time popup.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Left arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            moves focus to the previous carousel (time portion selector) in the time popup.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Up arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            selects the previous time in the current carousel (time portion selector) in the time popup.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Down arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            selects the next time in the current carousel (time portion selector) in the time popup.
        </span>
    </li>
</ul>

